<title>JAPAN: Hitachi Kiden Kogyo - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Hitachi Kiden Kogyo - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 10.35		vs	   18.87</p>
<p> Operating	  329    million    vs	  573    million</p>
<p> Current	    370    million    vs	  612    million</p>
<p> Net		  167    million    vs	  280    million</p>
<p> EPS		    7.78 yen	  vs	   14.72 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     22 million	  vs	  20 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.75 yen	  vs	    3.75 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Hitachi Kiden Kogyo Ltd is a crane and disposal treatment system maker affiliated with Hitachi.</p>
</text>
